        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, heat distribution system, air heating, specific heat demand 10W</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, heat distribution system, air heating, specific heat demand 10W
Disposal of the heat distribution for an air-heating system;
UUID: 10246ffa-63d4-4a45-accd-a89dd0f35cfc
Metals not included (cut-off to recycling); for other materials: disposal process according to waste material type; no transports included.
Location: Specific to the technology mix for waste treatment encountered in Switzerland.
Technology: Metal parts are recycled (cut off), plastic parts are incinerated, paint to final disposal, inert wastes (e.g. rock or glass wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material for average investigated in 2008. Process information partly from 2004. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on production input data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_10246ffa-63d4-4a45-accd-a89dd0f35cfc.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
